acceptable.body:
Do not use EchoPhase to:

- break the law or help others break it;
- send spam, harass, threaten or impersonate others;
- distribute malware or attack, probe or overload this or any other system;
- get around authentication, permissions, rate limits or other security measures;
- collect other people's personal data without their permission;
- break the terms of a connected platform or run bots that do;
- disrupt the service for other users.

To report a security problem, contact us privately instead of testing it on the live service.
